#: source/package-management/index.md:1
msgid ""
"This chapter discusses how to do package management with Nix, i.e., how to "
"obtain, install, upgrade, and erase packages. This is the “user’s” "
"perspective of the Nix system — people who want to _create_ packages should "
"consult the chapter on the [Nix language](../language/index.md)."
msgstr ""
